BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF’s “Upper Noe NeighborFest” Free Pizza\, Lemonade\, Popcor
 n + Gelato (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T210000
DTSTAMP:20260921T115400Z
UID:funcheap-20260926-sfsuppernoeneighborfestf
CATEGORIES:free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-upper-noe-neighborfest-free-pizza-
 lemonade-popcorn-gelato-2026/\nVenue: Greenlight\, SF Public Space Collect
 ive and Contina Impact. Upper Noe NeighborFes\nPrice: Free\nCategories: fr
 ee\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nUpper Noe NeighborFest is a free Goo
 d Neighbor Week community gathering at Upper Noe Rec Center featuring musi
 c by the Adrian West Band\, a MoBu Dance Studio performance\, activity boo
 ths\, archery\, volleyball\, games\, arts and crafts\, face painting\, and
  KidsZone activities. Free refreshments include popcorn\, lemonade\, pizza
 \, gelato\, cupcakes\, and more. Original Event Description: _EVERYBODY IS
  WELCOME AT UPPER NOE NEIGHBORFEST featuring the ADRIAN WEST BAND So\, com
 e celebrate Good Neighbor Week with us at Upper Noe Rec Center on Saturday
 \, September 26 from 11 to 2. The Adrian West Band\, a big hit at UN Block
  Party 2024\, return to provide upbeat tunes to delight everyone. MoBu Dan
 ce Studio performs at 11:45. Esteemed civic leaders will be there too. Rec
  & Park will have special activities like safe & fun archery\, volleyball 
 and games for all ages\, while kids can also enjoy arts & crafts with Aven
 turas\, face painting by Amanda\, and fun activities in the KidsZone. Free
  refreshments include popcorn\, lemonade\, pizza\, La Copa Loca Gelato\, D
 elights by Lisa cupcakes\, and more. Dozens of local merchants\, schools\,
  organizations and institutions will have booths with info\, activities an
 d treats.
LOCATION:Greenlight\, SF Public Space Collective and Contina Impact. Upper
  Noe NeighborFes
